WEBVTT

00:00:07.290 --> 00:00:08.760
Beyblade...

00:00:08.760 --> 00:00:12.310
The world's most enjoyable battling top game!

00:00:12.310 --> 00:00:14.310
The beys shot from their launchers,

00:00:14.310 --> 00:00:18.360
and the Bladers' passions 
all collide in the stadium!

00:00:22.130 --> 00:00:23.810
Beyblade Burst is...

00:00:23.810 --> 00:00:28.430
...the story of the kids who do battle, 
entrusting their dreams to their Beys.

00:00:31.050 --> 00:00:35.110
In the second round of the wbba. Beigoma regionals,

00:00:35.360 --> 00:00:38.370
I battled it out with the tough Kensuke Midorikawa!

00:00:39.140 --> 00:00:39.850
Ah!

00:00:44.290 --> 00:00:46.840
Go!

00:00:57.330 --> 00:00:58.950
What am I doing...?

00:00:58.950 --> 00:01:01.310
Making mistakes in such an important battle...

00:01:03.740 --> 00:01:05.490
This is the real fight...

00:01:06.020 --> 00:01:09.540
This battle's not over yet!

00:01:11.330 --> 00:01:12.110
Shoot!

00:01:17.570 --> 00:01:19.730
Valkyrie!

00:01:19.990 --> 00:01:22.760
Wow! Valkyrie regained its stance!

00:01:23.190 --> 00:01:25.570
Go!

00:01:32.950 --> 00:01:36.270
Keep going and knock Kerbeus right out!

00:01:44.360 --> 00:01:46.570
<i>Beyblade! Let's go</i>

00:01:44.360 --> 00:01:46.570
<i>Beyblade! Hajimeyou</i>

00:01:46.860 --> 00:01:52.040
<i>Become the ultimate Blader</i>

00:01:46.860 --> 00:01:52.040
<i>mezasou ze, saikyou no blader</i>

00:01:52.490 --> 00:01:57.620
<i>(Go! Burst! Go! Burst! Go! Burst! Beyblade Burst!)</i>

00:01:52.490 --> 00:01:57.620
<i>(Go! Burst! Go! Burst! Go! Burst! Beyblade Burst!)</i>

00:01:57.790 --> 00:02:02.500
<i>(Go! Burst! Go! Burst! Go! Go! Go! Burst!)</i>

00:01:57.790 --> 00:02:02.500
<i>(Go! Burst! Go! Burst! Go! Go! Go! Burst!)</i>

00:02:03.460 --> 00:02:06.760
<i>Yeah, everyone's got it</i>

00:02:03.460 --> 00:02:06.760
<i>kitto, dare datte mottenda</i>

00:02:07.260 --> 00:02:13.850
<i>The desire to win... and a Beyblade just for them!</i>

00:02:07.260 --> 00:02:13.850
<i>kachitaitte kanjou to... kimi dake no beibureedo!</i>

00:02:14.220 --> 00:02:16.770
<i>That's right, facing each other now</i>

00:02:14.220 --> 00:02:16.770
<i>sou, mukiatta hyoujou ni</i>

00:02:17.310 --> 00:02:23.900
<i>The will to become stronger starts boiling up, right?</i>

00:02:17.310 --> 00:02:23.900
<i>tsuyoku naritaitte kimochi ga hora, uzumaitendarou?</i>

00:02:24.070 --> 00:02:30.120
<i>Shoot! The throbbing of your spinning dreams (Burst!)</i>

00:02:24.070 --> 00:02:30.120
<i>SHOOT! mawari dashita yume no kodou</i>

00:02:30.160 --> 00:02:34.620
<i>Burn (Burst!) strong (Burst!), your hearts pound</i>

00:02:30.160 --> 00:02:34.620
<i>atsuku hajike, takanariau</i>

00:02:34.750 --> 00:02:36.830
<i>(3, 2, 1! Go Shoot!)</i>

00:02:34.750 --> 00:02:36.830
<i>(3, 2, 1! Go Shoot!)</i>

00:02:36.960 --> 00:02:39.540
<i>When two people (Go! Burst!)</i>

00:02:36.960 --> 00:02:39.540
<i>zettai katsundatte iu</i>

00:02:39.540 --> 00:02:41.840
<i>who've got the drive to win (Go! Burst!)</i>

00:02:39.540 --> 00:02:41.840
<i>honki no omoi doushi ga</i>

00:02:41.840 --> 00:02:43.840
<i>battle it out (Burst! Burst! Burst! Burst!)</i>

00:02:41.840 --> 00:02:43.840
<i>butsukattara</i>

00:02:44.250 --> 00:02:47.010
<i>bonds are formed (Go! Burst!)</i>

00:02:44.250 --> 00:02:47.010
<i>kizuna ga umareru no sa</i>

00:02:47.090 --> 00:02:49.680
<i>When it's time for the climax (Go! Burst!)</i>

00:02:47.090 --> 00:02:49.680
<i>ketteiteki shunkan</i>

00:02:49.800 --> 00:02:52.140
<i>face it off... together! (Go! Burst!)</i>

00:02:49.800 --> 00:02:52.140
<i>oikakeyou... issho ni!</i>

00:02:52.260 --> 00:02:57.430
<i>Can't stop, I'll finish this, with the! best! (Go!)</i>

00:02:52.260 --> 00:02:57.430
<i>mou tomaranai, kimeru no sa  sai! kyou!</i>

00:02:57.680 --> 00:03:01.150
<i>Burst Finish!</i>

00:02:57.680 --> 00:03:01.150
<i>Baasuto Finisshu o!</i>

00:03:01.610 --> 00:03:03.650
<i>(3, 2, 1! Go Shoot!)</i>

00:03:01.610 --> 00:03:03.650
<i>(3, 2, 1! Go Shoot!)</i>

00:03:06.560 --> 00:03:11.560
Blast-Off! Rush Shoot!!

00:03:11.850 --> 00:03:15.470
This movement... it's the Rush Shoot!

00:03:24.040 --> 00:03:26.770
Valkyrie just keeps on attacking!

00:03:29.160 --> 00:03:30.160
All right!

00:03:33.660 --> 00:03:35.900
Send it flying!

00:03:36.190 --> 00:03:38.590
Bro's Rush Shoot's gonna end this!

00:03:38.590 --> 00:03:39.660
Yay!

00:03:39.660 --> 00:03:40.810
He's won this!

00:03:41.410 --> 00:03:42.940
No, wait.

00:03:43.700 --> 00:03:45.440
It's guarding all of the attacks.

00:03:48.260 --> 00:03:49.700
Wh-Wh-Wh-What!?

00:03:49.820 --> 00:03:53.740
Kaiser Kerberus is completely nullifying 
all of the Rush Shoot's attacks!

00:03:57.760 --> 00:04:00.200
Kerberus's chain-like Layer

00:04:01.410 --> 00:04:03.890
is dispersing the damage across its body.

00:04:04.690 --> 00:04:08.420
So does that mean the Rush Shoot won't work!?

00:04:09.860 --> 00:04:13.930
Plus, the Press Driver clings against the stadium

00:04:14.260 --> 00:04:16.950
making Kerbeus's axle not waver in the slightest.

00:04:17.500 --> 00:04:18.930
No way...

00:04:18.930 --> 00:04:20.040
Bro...

00:04:21.880 --> 00:04:24.990
Rush Shoot won't work on Kerbeus!

00:04:24.990 --> 00:04:28.740
Doesn't matter if you make the shoot or not!

00:04:29.270 --> 00:04:33.370
Valt Aoi! For Kerbeus, a Defense Type,

00:04:33.370 --> 00:04:37.090
fighting your Attack Type Valkyrie is easy as pie!

00:04:38.990 --> 00:04:40.920
UNBELIEVABLE!

00:04:40.920 --> 00:04:42.920
Will any attack at all work!?

00:04:43.530 --> 00:04:48.040
This is the Guard Dog of the 
Underworld, Kaiser Kerbeus!

00:04:49.040 --> 00:04:50.050
We're not done yet!

00:04:50.050 --> 00:04:53.370
Don't look down on my Valkyrie!

00:04:53.370 --> 00:04:56.630
Valkyrie's attacks are still going!

00:04:56.630 --> 00:04:58.150
It's attacking even harder!

00:04:58.310 --> 00:05:00.510
Rush, rush, rush!

00:05:00.530 --> 00:05:02.630
Kerbeus is definitely faltering!

00:05:02.630 --> 00:05:04.720
Is it slowly taking damage!?

00:05:06.950 --> 00:05:07.960
What!?

00:05:08.800 --> 00:05:10.960
It's gradually slowing down!

00:05:13.860 --> 00:05:16.160
Go, Valkyrie!

00:05:18.240 --> 00:05:20.700
Show him what you've got, Kerbeus!

00:05:31.740 --> 00:05:37.380
Kerbeus returns to the stadium while 
Valkyrie makes some minor attacks!

00:05:37.380 --> 00:05:40.590
This is a test of stamina!

00:05:41.480 --> 00:05:44.100
Both of them are starting to slow down...?

00:05:44.650 --> 00:05:49.370
This never-ending spin-off is what 
will determine this second battle!

00:05:57.870 --> 00:05:59.650
Keep going, Valkyrie!

00:06:00.020 --> 00:06:02.850
If it's about holding out, Kerbeus won't lose!

00:06:03.710 --> 00:06:05.900
Now, Kerbeus or Valkyrie!?

00:06:05.900 --> 00:06:08.350
Who will be the one spinning in the end!?

00:06:18.180 --> 00:06:22.240
What!? It looks like they had a 
Spin Finish at the same time!

00:06:26.210 --> 00:06:27.140
Which was it!?

00:06:27.380 --> 00:06:29.790
Huh!? Who was first!?

00:06:29.790 --> 00:06:31.790
It was pretty much the same time, wasn't it?

00:06:32.400 --> 00:06:34.030
Kakitani, which was it!?

00:06:34.030 --> 00:06:36.190
Huh? Which...?

00:06:36.190 --> 00:06:39.200
You always referee, so you should know, right?

00:06:39.200 --> 00:06:41.110
Yeah, which was it?

00:06:41.110 --> 00:06:42.270
Ummm...

00:06:53.620 --> 00:06:57.260
Simultaneous Spin Finish. No points.

00:07:01.180 --> 00:07:04.650
Hey, what happens now?

00:07:04.940 --> 00:07:08.220
The second battle was a tie game, 
so now we go to the Third Battle.

00:07:08.220 --> 00:07:10.550
So the battle keeps going, then!

00:07:10.930 --> 00:07:12.410
Of course!

00:07:12.410 --> 00:07:15.750
Battles go on until someone wins.

00:07:16.540 --> 00:07:20.210
But Valt's gonna lose if he loses another point...

00:07:21.200 --> 00:07:22.880
You can do it, Bro!

00:07:22.880 --> 00:07:23.960
Good luck!

00:07:24.510 --> 00:07:26.860
Valkyrie. You did a good job.

00:07:28.170 --> 00:07:30.610
I didn't even give you a good Rush Shoot,

00:07:31.390 --> 00:07:35.140
and yet you still fought until the very end.

00:07:35.700 --> 00:07:38.360
You're the best partner a guy could have.

00:07:40.870 --> 00:07:44.220
I'm gonna finish this with the perfect Rush Shoot!

00:07:45.860 --> 00:07:50.180
Wow! Valt Aoi's claiming 
he'll do another Rush Shoot!

00:07:50.420 --> 00:07:54.290
He's gonna do another 
Rush Shoot in the third battle!

00:07:54.530 --> 00:07:58.980
This time I'll definitely do it perfectly!

00:07:59.820 --> 00:08:02.340
What an idiot. He's messed up big now.

00:08:02.850 --> 00:08:07.710
If his opponent knows he's gonna do 
it again, they'll be able to counter it.

00:08:07.710 --> 00:08:10.440
He could just be trying to bluff to throw them off.

00:08:11.120 --> 00:08:15.070
There's no way an idiot like that 
would do something so smart.

00:08:15.370 --> 00:08:19.380
Valt, you idiot! Why'd you say that!?

00:08:19.700 --> 00:08:23.730
Don't just give away what you're gonna do 
to your opponent when you've got the advantage!

00:08:23.730 --> 00:08:26.170
You need to think strategically, Bro!

00:08:26.530 --> 00:08:27.380
Don't bother.

00:08:29.140 --> 00:08:31.690
Valt can't hear anyone right now.

00:08:32.160 --> 00:08:36.430
And he's not looking anywhere 
except for at his Valkyrie.

00:08:36.640 --> 00:08:40.820
I'll... I'll finish this with a Rush Shoot...

00:08:42.820 --> 00:08:43.860
This is bad.

00:08:44.890 --> 00:08:45.860
Why?

00:08:46.250 --> 00:08:47.830
He does this every time.

00:08:48.220 --> 00:08:51.390
He's getting nervous again.

00:08:51.770 --> 00:08:54.180
It's the same as when he faced me.

00:08:54.540 --> 00:08:57.360
This dummy never learns, geez!

00:08:58.740 --> 00:09:00.780
I-I'll do it...

00:09:08.400 --> 00:09:10.030
He's red all over.

00:09:10.440 --> 00:09:12.900
So embarrassed that steam is coming out his ears.

00:09:13.730 --> 00:09:15.490
Another Mis-Shoot, huh?

00:09:16.390 --> 00:09:20.550
Looks like the winner's gonna be the puppet guy.

00:09:21.590 --> 00:09:22.760
Ouch...

00:09:23.140 --> 00:09:25.020
What am I doing...?

00:09:31.470 --> 00:09:33.760
Oh, what're you doing?

00:09:33.760 --> 00:09:35.250
Get it together!

00:09:56.440 --> 00:09:59.120
Big brother! Just relax!

00:09:59.120 --> 00:10:02.910
Yeah! A Bey like that's usually no match for you, bro!

00:10:03.200 --> 00:10:05.920
Valt, chill out!

00:10:07.860 --> 00:10:11.200
Yeah! I've got this! Don't worry about me!

00:10:11.610 --> 00:10:13.920
Oh, big brother looked over here!

00:10:13.920 --> 00:10:15.520
He heard us, too!!

00:10:15.960 --> 00:10:16.970
There we go.

00:10:17.140 --> 00:10:18.710
Looks like he's calmed down.

00:10:18.860 --> 00:10:20.800
Thanks to me.

00:10:27.490 --> 00:10:28.800
Battlers, face forward.

00:10:31.020 --> 00:10:32.010
Valkyrie.

00:10:32.600 --> 00:10:36.490
We should be fine as long as we do what we practiced.

00:10:37.750 --> 00:10:40.740
Our defense is gonna be an iron wall this time!

00:10:40.740 --> 00:10:42.690
We'll win this!

00:10:42.690 --> 00:10:44.650
A Spin Finish win!

00:10:49.090 --> 00:10:50.320
Third battle.

00:10:55.190 --> 00:11:00.350
If I mess up this shoot again, 
you'll have the right to hate me, partner!

00:11:10.820 --> 00:11:15.580
Now, the third battle is about to begin with 
Kensuke Midorikawa at a one point lead.

00:11:15.590 --> 00:11:17.330
It's finally starting!

00:11:18.750 --> 00:11:20.510
Ready, set!

00:11:21.090 --> 00:11:21.920
Three!

00:11:22.240 --> 00:11:23.170
Two!

00:11:23.340 --> 00:11:24.420
One!

00:11:24.590 --> 00:11:26.660
Go Shoot!

00:11:32.820 --> 00:11:34.670
Go!

00:11:34.670 --> 00:11:38.320
Victory Valkyrie's Layer is almost touching the stadium!

00:11:38.320 --> 00:11:40.380
It looks like it'll fall!

00:11:55.520 --> 00:11:57.500
Go!

00:12:07.440 --> 00:12:08.470
It's gonna fall!

00:12:11.490 --> 00:12:11.920
No.

00:12:12.770 --> 00:12:13.620
It's fine.

00:12:13.830 --> 00:12:15.770
Valkyrie isn't falling!

00:12:15.780 --> 00:12:16.980
It's staying up!

00:12:17.530 --> 00:12:22.970
The angle of the shoot you'd think would be too far 
down actually gave it a more powerful downforce

00:12:23.780 --> 00:12:25.200
Downforce?

00:12:25.900 --> 00:12:31.430
The air current the spinning is creating is 
strongly pushing the Bey down to the stadium.

00:12:32.090 --> 00:12:35.920
Victory Valkyrie is tightly clinging to the stadium!

00:12:36.750 --> 00:12:38.450
Its speed increased again.

00:12:38.450 --> 00:12:39.940
Amazing!

00:12:40.160 --> 00:12:42.110
Keep going!

00:12:42.330 --> 00:12:43.940
First contact!

00:12:44.260 --> 00:12:46.370
Valkyrie's moved back up!

00:12:46.370 --> 00:12:49.120
Even Kerbeus moved! Did it work!?

00:12:49.120 --> 00:12:50.770
Its defenses are being penetrated!

00:12:51.350 --> 00:12:54.340
Go, Valkyrie!

00:12:57.690 --> 00:13:01.050
Perfect! What an insane Rush Shoot!

00:13:01.050 --> 00:13:04.700
Valkyrie's powerful attacks 
keep raining down on Kerbeus!

00:13:07.410 --> 00:13:10.360
Woah! Kerbeus is getting knocked around!

00:13:10.370 --> 00:13:14.540
Kerbeus' defenses are being penetrated!

00:13:16.020 --> 00:13:18.100
Hang in there, Kerbeus!

00:13:18.100 --> 00:13:20.690
If we take the center, we'll win.

00:13:20.890 --> 00:13:24.130
Doesn't matter what you do, Rush Shoot'll win!

00:13:24.400 --> 00:13:25.580
What!?

00:13:26.020 --> 00:13:27.020
Valkyrie!

00:13:31.370 --> 00:13:34.960
Woah! Little by little, Kerbeus is slowing down!

00:13:34.960 --> 00:13:38.020
Valkyrie's attacks are breaking through!

00:13:39.110 --> 00:13:43.300
With Kerbeus being forced to move so much, 
it's starting to lose its spin!

00:13:43.590 --> 00:13:46.000
Wow! You rock, Bro!

00:13:46.530 --> 00:13:48.660
The Rush Shoot's speed won.

00:13:50.400 --> 00:13:51.380
Valt...

00:13:52.140 --> 00:13:55.740
Can Kerbeus' Press Driver handle it!?

00:14:00.240 --> 00:14:02.780
Kerbeus!

00:14:11.110 --> 00:14:15.130
Go, Valkyrie!

00:14:40.610 --> 00:14:44.040
Kerbeus burst!

00:14:49.450 --> 00:14:50.640
Burst Finish!

00:14:51.080 --> 00:14:55.200
Valt Aoi won with two points, 2-1!

00:14:55.330 --> 00:14:59.510
Amazing! A huge comeback victory for Victory Valkyrie!

00:15:02.810 --> 00:15:04.020
He won...

00:15:06.690 --> 00:15:08.610
Bro won!

00:15:09.100 --> 00:15:12.930
That bolt-for-brains actually did it!

00:15:13.680 --> 00:15:17.290
His ability to concentrate during 
critical moments is amazing.

00:15:17.920 --> 00:15:21.130
His Bey must really love him.

00:15:25.900 --> 00:15:27.860
Thanks, Valkyrie!

00:15:35.720 --> 00:15:38.040
I did it!

00:15:38.040 --> 00:15:41.190
Valt Aoi advances to the third round!

00:15:41.480 --> 00:15:44.580
Congratulations! Good job!

00:15:47.620 --> 00:15:51.490
I lost... with my Kerbeus...

00:15:52.590 --> 00:15:55.820
He's strong. This Valt Aoi...

00:15:59.030 --> 00:16:01.620
An unexpected next opponent, huh?

00:16:01.920 --> 00:16:04.760
I don't care who my opponent is.

00:16:05.100 --> 00:16:08.950
That Valkyrie Bey's pretty interesting.

00:16:09.240 --> 00:16:11.250
There's two types of Beys.

00:16:11.720 --> 00:16:14.450
Beys that win, and Beys that lose.

00:16:14.990 --> 00:16:17.730
I wonder which type yours is, Daina?

00:16:18.130 --> 00:16:20.430
Mine... wins.

00:16:28.440 --> 00:16:29.730
Let's shake hands.

00:16:31.270 --> 00:16:32.490
Shake hands!?

00:16:32.770 --> 00:16:35.580
Why would I shake hands with someone like you!?

00:16:35.580 --> 00:16:38.320
We won't ever shake hands with you.

00:16:38.440 --> 00:16:40.010
Don't be shy!

00:16:42.860 --> 00:16:46.500
Oh, so you wear the puppet like this?

00:16:46.500 --> 00:16:50.400
H-Hey! What are you doing!? Give Besu back!

00:16:50.400 --> 00:16:52.430
It's just for a second, c'mon!

00:16:52.430 --> 00:16:53.470
No way!

00:16:53.470 --> 00:16:54.770
It's fine!

00:16:54.770 --> 00:16:55.490
Give him back!

00:16:55.490 --> 00:16:56.820
He's so funny!

00:16:56.820 --> 00:16:58.910
Stop messing around, give him back!

00:17:01.260 --> 00:17:03.700
What are those two doing?

00:17:03.700 --> 00:17:05.580
It's like they're playing...

00:17:05.730 --> 00:17:07.500
They're already  friends!

00:17:07.900 --> 00:17:10.820
Big brother's a genius when 
it comes to making friends!

00:17:13.310 --> 00:17:15.250
Don't be so pleased with yourself!

00:17:15.740 --> 00:17:19.350
I wanted to have a cool win, 
but I ended up overdoing it a bit!

00:17:19.940 --> 00:17:21.520
Cool my butt!

00:17:21.520 --> 00:17:24.400
You still only beat me because of a fluke.

00:17:24.400 --> 00:17:26.320
This is basically a miracle!

00:17:26.320 --> 00:17:28.520
A fluke!?

00:17:28.520 --> 00:17:29.740
Oh, I get it, Honcho.

00:17:29.740 --> 00:17:32.390
You're just mad I beat you.

00:17:32.390 --> 00:17:33.380
What!?

00:17:33.380 --> 00:17:34.820
Huh!?

00:17:34.820 --> 00:17:36.690
I was the one that won.

00:17:36.320 --> 00:17:38.740
--Yeah, in your dreams.

00:17:36.740 --> 00:17:39.290
Oh... Shu, good luck!

00:17:40.270 --> 00:17:42.410
Your match is after this next one, right?

00:17:42.410 --> 00:17:43.680
Don't lose!

00:17:43.840 --> 00:17:44.570
Yeah.

00:17:45.170 --> 00:17:49.090
There's no way he'd lose. 
Unlike a certain bolt-for-brains.

00:17:49.400 --> 00:17:50.330
What!?

00:17:50.330 --> 00:17:51.710
Huh!?

00:17:54.100 --> 00:17:57.070
Okay! Boys, girls, everyone!

00:17:57.270 --> 00:18:00.800
A-Block's 2nd match of the 2nd round is starting!

00:18:00.910 --> 00:18:03.110
The bladers here are

00:18:03.120 --> 00:18:04.470
Daina Kurogami, and

00:18:04.750 --> 00:18:06.640
Melos Nekota!

00:18:08.080 --> 00:18:11.170
Deathscyther, let's end this in one hit.

00:18:12.290 --> 00:18:17.180
Dark Deathscyther is an Attack Type, 
and mine's a Defense Type.

00:18:17.300 --> 00:18:19.730
No doubt about it, I've got the advantage.

00:18:20.200 --> 00:18:23.660
Woah, an Attack Type and Defense Type battle!?

00:18:23.660 --> 00:18:26.350
It's just like the first match!

00:18:27.480 --> 00:18:33.110
Even against another Attack Type, 
my Dark Deathscyther is much stronger.

00:18:33.110 --> 00:18:34.590
I'll show you the difference in power.

00:18:35.050 --> 00:18:38.620
Another super cocky dude's shown up.

00:18:38.620 --> 00:18:41.460
But... he really does look strong!

00:18:43.820 --> 00:18:47.460
Huh!? In his first match, he Burst 
his opponent in 10 seconds!

00:18:48.460 --> 00:18:50.270
Five seconds is enough for this.

00:18:51.030 --> 00:18:54.990
Woah... Daina Kurogami said 
he's gonna finish it instantly!

00:18:54.990 --> 00:18:56.180
In five seconds, even!

00:18:56.440 --> 00:18:59.830
Five seconds... amazing.

00:19:01.020 --> 00:19:02.400
Five seconds!?

00:19:02.400 --> 00:19:04.520
Don't make fun of my Bey!

00:19:04.850 --> 00:19:06.580
I just stated the truth.

00:19:08.700 --> 00:19:11.910
Now the battle's getting heated up 
before it even started!

00:19:12.420 --> 00:19:14.800
It's psychological warfare!

00:19:15.660 --> 00:19:17.110
First battle!

00:19:18.980 --> 00:19:20.810
Ready, Set!

00:19:21.660 --> 00:19:24.310
Three, two, one...

00:19:24.440 --> 00:19:26.820
Go Shoot!

00:19:32.460 --> 00:19:36.880
Burst Finish! Over in one hit!

00:19:38.840 --> 00:19:41.410
Dark Deathscyther, Burst Finish!

00:19:41.720 --> 00:19:44.750
2 to 0, Kurogami Daina wins!

00:19:45.440 --> 00:19:49.760
A-Amazing! Five seconds, just like he said!

00:19:50.060 --> 00:19:52.810
Finishing in five seconds is a tournament record!

00:19:53.940 --> 00:19:57.030
Woah, woah... he's amazing!

00:19:57.040 --> 00:19:59.870
He really did finish it instantly!

00:20:01.920 --> 00:20:05.860
Now I'm just getting even more pumped up!

00:20:08.760 --> 00:20:10.910
Well, aren't you a show-off?

00:20:11.680 --> 00:20:14.690
I'll be doing the same to you.

00:20:14.870 --> 00:20:16.690
Now I wonder about that.

00:20:17.100 --> 00:20:20.300
My Bey, Wild Wyvern, is pretty tough...

00:20:21.640 --> 00:20:22.480
Huh?

00:20:24.390 --> 00:20:29.080
Another Burst Finish within five seconds!

00:20:29.380 --> 00:20:32.880
The same time as Daina Kurogami!

00:20:33.570 --> 00:20:39.790
The next major contender to win is 
Shu Kurenai's Storm Spriggan! Insanely powerful!

00:20:40.530 --> 00:20:43.740
Shu is so cool!

00:20:43.930 --> 00:20:45.380
He's awesome!

00:20:45.580 --> 00:20:47.720
Shu really is strong!

00:20:47.940 --> 00:20:51.620
Valt's been winning too! Our school's awesome!

00:20:51.620 --> 00:20:54.740
Well, we didn't think Valt would get this far...

00:20:57.970 --> 00:21:01.440
The only worthy opponent of mine here is Shu Kurenai.

00:21:01.930 --> 00:21:04.370
I'm looking forward to the finals.

00:21:09.850 --> 00:21:10.920
Shu!

00:21:11.400 --> 00:21:13.670
You're amazing, man!

00:21:13.670 --> 00:21:16.500
With that much practice it's no surprise!

00:21:16.500 --> 00:21:18.850
You get me fired up!

00:21:19.460 --> 00:21:20.180
Yeah.

00:21:20.650 --> 00:21:24.030
Typical from someone who's my rival!

00:21:24.310 --> 00:21:26.530
Rivals sure are awesome!

00:21:27.130 --> 00:21:30.010
When they battle, their will to fight is mu...

00:21:31.280 --> 00:21:34.640
Mu... Mu... ummm...

00:21:34.930 --> 00:21:36.130
Mutual?

00:21:36.590 --> 00:21:38.170
Yeah, that's the word!

00:21:40.140 --> 00:21:43.700
Us rivals need to face off in the finals!

00:21:43.700 --> 00:21:46.800
Yeah, yeah! Rivals are great!

00:21:46.800 --> 00:21:48.610
You forgetting someone!?

00:21:49.360 --> 00:21:51.440
We're all rivals!

00:21:51.710 --> 00:21:52.900
All right!

00:21:52.590 --> 00:21:53.970
--You're assuming things.

00:21:54.160 --> 00:21:57.510
It's fine to assume stuff like this!

00:21:57.910 --> 00:21:59.390
Beybattles...

00:22:00.580 --> 00:22:02.960
really are fun!

00:22:19.170 --> 00:22:25.520
<i>With huge hopes stuffed in my bag</i>

00:22:19.170 --> 00:22:25.520
<i>ookina kibou wo baggu ni tsumekonde</i>

00:22:25.650 --> 00:22:32.010
<i>The train set off towards the future</i>

00:22:25.650 --> 00:22:32.010
<i>ressha wa mirai e ima hashiri dashita</i>

00:22:32.190 --> 00:22:37.610
<i>Holding the ticket to my dreams close</i>

00:22:32.190 --> 00:22:37.610
<i>yume no kippu wo gyutto nigirishimete</i>

00:22:38.050 --> 00:22:46.770
<i>I move forward, without a doubt in my mind</i>

00:22:38.050 --> 00:22:46.770
<i>osorezu ni susumu mou keshite mayowanai kara</i>

00:22:48.050 --> 00:22:51.210
<i>On these long and winding rails</i>

00:22:48.050 --> 00:22:51.210
<i>hatenaku tsuzuku nagai reeru</i>

00:22:51.250 --> 00:22:54.370
<i>Where you get off is up to you</i>

00:22:51.250 --> 00:22:54.370
<i>shuuchakuten wa jibun de kimeru</i>

00:22:54.450 --> 00:22:56.680
<i>Chase it, chase it</i>

00:22:54.450 --> 00:22:56.680
<i>oikakete oikakete</i>

00:22:56.720 --> 00:23:00.940
<i>I know your dreams will come true some day</i>

00:22:56.720 --> 00:23:00.940
<i>mieru keshiki ga aru to boku wa shinjiteru</i>

00:23:01.080 --> 00:23:06.680
<i>Run, keep running, run far</i>

00:23:01.080 --> 00:23:06.680
<i>hashitte hashiri tsuzukete, kakenukeru</i>

00:23:06.850 --> 00:23:10.810
<i>Get past the countless tears</i>

00:23:06.850 --> 00:23:10.810
<i>ikutsumo no namida o koete</i>

00:23:10.900 --> 00:23:13.790
<i>so we can be stronger</i>

00:23:10.900 --> 00:23:13.790
<i>bokura wa tsuyoku naru</i>

00:23:13.970 --> 00:23:19.520
<i>Some day we'll get glory, so until then</i>

00:23:13.970 --> 00:23:19.520
<i>itsuka eikou o tsukamu sono hi made</i>

00:23:19.700 --> 00:23:23.080
<i>Turn your dreams into reality</i>

00:23:19.700 --> 00:23:23.080
<i>yume wa yume no mama janai</i>

00:23:23.340 --> 00:23:27.430
<i>Our endless adventure continues</i>

00:23:23.340 --> 00:23:27.430
<i>owarinai tabi wa tsuzuku</i>

00:23:36.500 --> 00:23:38.640
I just had a really good idea!

00:23:38.970 --> 00:23:41.370
We need to make a Beyblade Club at school!

00:23:41.570 --> 00:23:43.480
I can train whenever I want if I do!

00:23:44.070 --> 00:23:45.810
First I gotta get some members!

00:23:46.240 --> 00:23:50.600
Five of them! No, ten! No, a hundred! No, a million!

00:23:51.280 --> 00:23:55.120
Next time on Beyblade Burst: 
"Beyblade Club: Let's Get Started"

00:23:55.270 --> 00:23:57.710
Three, two, one...

00:23:57.910 --> 00:23:59.940
Go Shoot!
